  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, when an attack is declared involving
    your monster and an opponent's monster: You can discard 1 Pendulum Monster; that
    opponent's monster loses 1000 ATK, until the end of this turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect
    ] \nYou can discard this card and 1 \"Performapal\" monster, except \"Performapal
    Ladyange\"; draw 2 cards. If this card is in your GY and you control an \"Odd-Eyes\"
    card or \"Performapal Gentrude\": You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone.
    You can only use 1 \"Performapal Ladyange\" effect per turn, and only once that
    turn."
